13	 * Runs after {@link ValidateNewOwner} has normalized the request's email to its lower-cased form
14	 * (see {@link OwnerEmail}), and before {@link BuildOwner}, so a duplicate is a 409 rather than a
15	 * persisted record. Each stored owner's email is lower-cased the same way before comparing. A
16	 * request without an email supplies nothing to conflict with and is left alone.
17	 */
